---
layout: null
---
{%- comment -%}
  這個檔案由 Jekyll 自動產生所有店家資料，不要手動填入店家。
  新增欄位時：在下面的 fields 清單加上欄位名稱即可。
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign fields = "name,branch,status,address,zip,city,district,lat,lng,coords_approx,price_level,price_note,rating,tags,hours,hours_checked,dishes,photos,visited,updated,links" | split: "," -%}
[
{%- for shop in site.shops -%}
  {%- assign slug = shop.path | split: "/" | last | replace: ".md", "" -%}
  {
    "slug": {{ slug | jsonify }},
    {%- for f in fields %}
    {{ f | jsonify }}: {{ shop[f] | jsonify }},
    {%- endfor %}
    "body": {{ shop.content | markdownify | strip | jsonify }}
  }{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}
{%- endfor %}
]
